All four decoding strategies likewise yield $\Kempirical{=}2$ (Table~\ref{tab:s2_decoding}); the 1v2 spread due to generation mode ($\Delta = 8.4$\,pp) exceeds the spread across models ($\Delta = 3.9$\,pp).
